## Quick start

{% if database == "sqlite3" %}Install dependencies, apply migrations, and run Wagtail locally:
{%- else %}Create the local environment file, start the database container, install
dependencies, apply migrations, and run Wagtail locally:
{%- endif %}

```shell
{% if database != "sqlite3" %}cp .env.example .env
{% endif %}make dev
```

The site is available at <http://localhost:8000>. In another terminal, from the
project root, create an administrator and follow the prompts:

```shell
